        "Its typical jobs on this platform are backfills and migrations. It loads history that predates the streaming lane, moves an old Hadoop or file-server data set into S3 before switching it off, copies an archive from another cloud during a consolidation, and copies between AWS storage services when a team needs files from EFS or FSx in S3.",
